  dialogues:
  - name: technician
    lines:
    - ' It doesn''t look very good...'
    - Hey young man! Can you get me the? I'm quite busy here
    - I just remember plugging it in at the west entrance...
    condition: 7
    triggers:
    - condition: 1
      value: 1
    - condition: 2
      value: 0
    - condition: 3
      value: 0
  - name: technician
    lines:
    - Here it is! Thank you, young man
    - You know, working the night shift isn't easy at all...
    - Maybe this is probably my last month working on this train....
    - Anyway, thank you. If you need anything, you can tell me.
    - Lighter? Oh, I brought it with me
    - ' You can take it if you want. I don''t need it anymore either.'
    condition: 2
    triggers:
    - condition: 1
      value: 0
    - condition: 2
      value: 0
    - condition: 3
      value: 1
  - name: technician
    lines:
    - have you find it? I plugged it at west entrance
    condition: 1
    triggers: []
  - name: technician
    lines:
    - Seem like he is working. I should not disturb him.
    condition: 3
    triggers: []
